<p>To achieve more reasonable and effective funding rates for TradFi perpetual contracts, Bybit will set the funding rate collection interval for TradFi perp contracts to every <strong>8 hours</strong>, and remove the automatic adjustment mechanism for funding rate collection intervals.</p>
<p></p>
<p>This 8‑hour interval will remain in effect unless otherwise announced. This change shall take effect at <strong>2026‑08‑07 16:00（UTC+0).<br/><br/></strong></p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>Note:<span> </span></strong>Funding rates and intervals may be adjusted further in extreme market conditions. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, always refer to our latest announcements.</p>
